test_version.py is pypa/packaging's test of its Version class, copied unchanged as test data
on 24 November 2026 from
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pypa/packaging/8fb1b46edad14e6fa2f0af581d65d7567f70e3b0/tests/test_version.py.
It is read as data by the comparator's tests in src/vulnerabilities.rs and never run.

